Current CPU load:
 userspace: 0%, kernel: 1%, interrupts: 0% iowaits: 0%

```
Sample 1 read `1 second: 0%, 20 seconds: 0%, 60 seconds: 0%`. The load averages
(0.38 / 0.47 / 0.20) are the tail of the boot two minutes earlier and are already falling.
**The CPU is not busy after the traffic stopped.**

**`show memory`**
```
RAM total: 8092132 kB; free: 7457572 kB; buffers: 1360 kB
```
Sample 1: `free: 7461884 kB`. Sample 2: `free: 7457572 kB`. A difference of **4312 kB out of
